flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Get Model Responses]
    B --> C[Synthesize Responses]
    C --> D{Check Confidence}
    D -- Confidence ≥ Threshold --> E[Return Final Result]
    D -- Confidence < Threshold --> F{Max Iterations Reached?}
    F -- No --> G[Prepare Next Iteration]
    G --> B
    F -- Yes --> E